  "ttkDefinition": "Ideal mechanical chest TTK is measured from the first damaging shell/projectile to the lethal shell/projectile against 100 HP, excludes projectile flight time, and for pellet loads assumes every pellet in the shell connects. Pump/pair cadence is weapon-specific rather than derived from the analyzer raw RPM field.",
