    "buckshot",
    "flechette",
    "slugs"
  ],
  "excludedAmmo": {
    "buckshot_00": "Exact current full #00 Buckshot pellet-count/damage/range curve is not exposed in the current analyzer ammo transform or sufficiently complete independent source. It is legal but excluded from VERIFIED META until validated."
  },
  "notes": [
    "Current Analyzer shotgun damage curves are per pellet; audited #01/Flechette shell damage multiplies the per-pellet curve by 16 pellets.",
    "Flechette uses the same direct-damage/TTK curve as #01 Buckshot; its penetration/regen utility remains a separate non-TTK property.",
    "Slugs are audited as one projectile with their own current range damage curve and 1.34x headshot multiplier; this gate is chest-only.",
    "M87A1 uses 94 RPM effective pump cadence. The analyzer raw ~1800 RPM field is an internal event rate and must not be used as effective follow-up cadence.",
    "DB-12 uses 360 RPM within its two-shell pair and ~800 ms from pair start to the next pair start; sustained display cadence is ~150 RPM.",
    "DB-12 current #01 close shell damage is 89.6 (5.6 x 16), superseding the older 80-damage close value.",
    "Shotguns are intentionally excluded from cross-class AUTO VERIFIED ranking until spread/pellet hit probability is modeled; ideal all-pellet long-range TTK is not comparable to rifle hit certainty."
  ],
